            <h3>NIUA</h3>
            <div class="meta">Gate that proves AI-made robots, motion, and 3D scenes before they ship</div>
            <p>I built NIUA as an AI fullstack product: agents (or people) submit a file, NIUA checks it against a typed contract, replays it in physics on CPU, and returns a signed pass/fail receipt. Live tracks cover robot URDFs/MJCFs, Unitree G1 motion clips, and Gaussian splat scenes. Simulation only; no hardware tested. Connects over HTTP MCP and a playground at ohao.tech.</p>
